<tr valign="top" height="300" >
<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<table class="MsoNormalTable" border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" width="600" style="border-collapse: collapse; border: none;"><tbody><tr style="height: 142.5pt;"><td width="600" valign="top" style="width: 6.25in; border: none; padding: 0in 30pt 8pt; height: 142.5pt;"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0in; line-height: 18.3333px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><span lang="EN" style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 20px;">Dear Valued Investor,<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0in; line-height: 18.3333px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><span lang="EN" style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 20px;">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0in; line-height: 18.3333px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><span lang="EN" style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 20px;">It is time for your annual property and liability insurance policy through Valentine Insurance Services to be renewed.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0in; line-height: 18.3333px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><span lang="EN" style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 20px;">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0in; line-height: 18.3333px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><span lang="EN" style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 20px;">This renewal email was updated recently, so please be sure to read it in its entirety.&nbsp; As always, thank you for your time and attention to this important information.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0in; line-height: 18.3333px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><span lang="EN" style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 20px;"><br></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0in; line-height: 18.3333px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><span lang="EN" style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 20px;"><b style="font-size: 14.6667px; text-align: center;"><span lang="EN" style="font-size: 15pt; line-height: 35px;">Overview of Important Details:</span></b></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0in; line-height: 18.3333px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><span lang="EN" style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 20px;"></span></p><table class="MsoNormalTable" border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" width="446" style="margin-left: 3pt; border-collapse: collapse; border: none;"><tbody><tr style="height: 107.25pt;"><td width="446" valign="top" style="width: 334.5pt; border: none; padding: 15pt 15pt 11pt 0in; height: 107.25pt;"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0in; line-height: 19.9467px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><b><span lang="EN" style="font-size: 18pt; line-height: 32.64px;">*</span></b><b><span lang="EN" style="font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 19.04px;">Your new policy will provide Replacement Cost Coverage up to the Reported (Insured) Value on your Evidence of Insurance (EOI) plus 25%, if applicable.&nbsp; The EOI uploaded in your owner’s portal includes a Reported (Insured) Value consistent with a minimum of $120 per square foot.<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0in; line-height: 19.9467px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><b><span lang="EN" style="font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 19.04px;"><br></span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0in; line-height: 19.9467px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><b><span lang="EN" style="font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 19.04px;">If your&nbsp;</span></b><b style="font-size: 14.6667px;"><span lang="EN" style="font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 19.04px;">EOI</span></b><b><span lang="EN" style="font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 19.04px;">&nbsp;shows the premium is escrowed from a lender, we will invoice the lender and await their payment. Please verify that your lender’s name and loan # are correct on your&nbsp;</span></b><b style="font-size: 14.6667px;"><span lang="EN" style="font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 19.04px;">EOI</span></b><b><span lang="EN" style="font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 19.04px;">. If either the lender or loan number have changed, please let us know promptly.<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0in; line-height: 19.9467px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><b><span lang="EN" style="font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 19.04px;"><br>If your EOI shows the premium is non-escrowed or it has no mortgage company listed, we will be deducting the premium from your rental account at Premier Property Management mid-month of the month following your renewal date.</span></b></p><table class="MsoNormalTable" border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" width="450" style="border-collapse: collapse; border: none;"><tbody><tr style="height: 108.1pt;"><td width="450" valign="top" style="width: 337.5pt; border: none; padding: 15pt 15pt 11pt 0in; height: 108.1pt;"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0in; line-height: 19.9467px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><b><span lang="EN" style="font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 19.04px;">If management of the property ends for any reason, the insurance policy will terminate effective the same date that management is terminated.<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0in; line-height: 19.9467px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><b><span lang="EN" style="font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 19.04px;"><br></span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0in; line-height: 19.9467px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><b><span lang="EN" style="font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 19.04px;">Have you recently put a property into an LLC or Trust? If so, have you notified our insurance department so that your coverage details can be updated? If not, please email insurance@reination.com and let us know so we can have your insurance documents updated.&nbsp;</span></b></p><table class="MsoNormalTable" border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" width="450" style="border-collapse: collapse; border: none;"><tbody><tr style="height: 108.1pt;"><td width="450" valign="top" style="width: 337.5pt; border: none; padding: 15pt 15pt 11pt 0in; height: 108.1pt;"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0in; line-height: 19.9467px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><b><span lang="EN" style="font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 19.04px;"><br></span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0in; line-height: 19.9467px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><b><i><span lang="EN" style="font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 24.5px;">*If you would like to discuss the Reported (Insured) Value of your property further, have Valentine Insurance run a replacement cost estimate for you, or discuss other options, please reach out to our dedicated Valentine team at 1-800-772-0535 or email at investorinsurance@valentine.insure.*</span></i></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0in; line-height: 19.9467px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><b><i><span lang="EN" style="font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 24.5px;"><br></span></i></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0in; line-height: 19.9467px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><b style="text-align: center;"><span lang="EN" style="font-size: 15pt; line-height: 35px;">Property Under Renewal:</span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0in; line-height: 19.9467px;"><span style="text-align: center;"><span lang="EN" style="line-height: 35px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><u>{!Insurance__c.Opportunity__c}</u></font></span></span></p><table class="MsoNormalTable" border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" width="600" style="border-collapse: collapse; border: none;"><tbody><tr style="height: 81pt;"><td width="600" valign="top" style="width: 6.25in; border: none; padding: 14pt 30pt 0in; height: 81pt;"><p class="MsoNormal" align="center" style="margin: 0in; line-height: 22px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; text-align: center;"><b><span lang="EN" style="font-size: 14pt; line-height: 28px;">How To Access Your 2026 Evidence of Insurance (EOI&amp;FAQ) Document:</span></b></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0in; line-height: 16.8667px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><span lang="EN" style="font-size: 11.5pt; line-height: 17.6333px;">&nbsp;</span></p><table class="MsoNormalTable" border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" width="600" style="border-collapse: collapse; border: none;"><tbody><tr style="height: 260.25pt;"><td width="600" valign="top" style="width: 6.25in; border: none; padding: 12pt 15pt 8pt; height: 260.25pt;"><div style="border-top: none; border-right: none; border-bottom: none; border-image: initial; border-left: 1pt none windowtext; padding: 0in 0in 0in 30pt;"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0in; line-height: 14.2267px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; border: none; padding: 0in;"><b><span lang="EN" style="font-size: 11.5pt; line-height: 14.8733px;">• Go to your owner's portal for the property in question.<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0in; line-height: 14.2267px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; border: none; padding: 0in;"><span lang="EN" style="font-size: 11.5pt; line-height: 14.8733px;">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0in; line-height: 14.2267px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; border: none; padding: 0in;"><b><span lang="EN" style="font-size: 11.5pt; line-height: 14.8733px;">• From your dashboard, click "Documents" on the left side menu.&nbsp;</span></b><b><span lang="EN" style="font-size: 9pt; line-height: 11.64px;">("Statements" will appear at the top.)<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0in; line-height: 14.2267px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; border: none; padding: 0in;"><span lang="EN" style="font-size: 11.5pt; line-height: 14.8733px;">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0in; line-height: 14.2267px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; border: none; padding: 0in;"><b><span lang="EN" style="font-size: 11.5pt; line-height: 14.8733px;">• Scroll down to the "Other Documents" section. At the bottom of this section, choose "Show 100 entries" from the dropdown menu.<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0in; line-height: 14.2267px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; border: none; padding: 0in;"><span lang="EN" style="font-size: 11.5pt; line-height: 14.8733px;">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0in; line-height: 14.2267px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; border: none; padding: 0in;"><b><span lang="EN" style="font-size: 11.5pt; line-height: 14.8733px;">• Scroll back up to the heading "Other Documents." On the right-hand side please click the "uploaded" word twice so the most recent dates appear near the top of the list.<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0in; line-height: 14.2267px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; border: none; padding: 0in;"><span lang="EN" style="font-size: 11.5pt; line-height: 14.8733px;">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0in; line-height: 14.2267px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; border: none; padding: 0in;"><b><span lang="EN" style="font-size: 11.5pt; line-height: 14.8733px;">• Search list for house number&nbsp;</span></b><b><span lang="EN" style="font-size: 9pt; line-height: 11.64px;">(example "399 Savage Lane, EOI&amp;FAQ, xx/xx/2026")</span></b><b><span lang="EN" style="font-size: 11.5pt; line-height: 14.8733px;">&nbsp;to access your EOI.<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0in; line-height: 14.2267px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; border: none; padding: 0in;"><span lang="EN" style="font-size: 11.5pt; line-height: 14.8733px;">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0in; line-height: 14.2267px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; border: none; padding: 0in;"><b><span lang="EN" style="font-size: 11.5pt; line-height: 14.8733px;">• Click the name of the file and it will download to a pdf. Please review all pages.</span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0in; line-height: 14.2267px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; border: none; padding: 0in;"><span lang="EN" style="font-size: 11.5pt; line-height: 14.8733px;"><span style="font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br><br></span></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0in; line-height: 18.3333px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;">Thank you for your attention to these matters.&nbsp; It is greatly appreciated.&nbsp;</span></p><div><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;"><br></span></div><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0in; line-height: 14.2267px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; border: none; padding: 0in;"><span lang="EN" style="font-size: 11.5pt; line-height: 14.8733px;"><span style="font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">- Jill Griffith</span></span></p></div></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><table class="MsoNormalTable" border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" width="446" style="margin-left: 3pt; border-collapse: collapse; border: none;"><tbody><tr style="height: 107.25pt;"><td width="446" valign="top" style="width: 334.5pt; border: none; padding: 15pt 15pt 11pt 0in; height: 107.25pt;"><table class="MsoNormalTable" border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" width="450" style="border-collapse: collapse; border: none;"><tbody><tr style="height: 108.1pt;"><td width="450" valign="top" style="width: 337.5pt; border: none; padding: 15pt 15pt 11pt 0in; height: 108.1pt;"><table class="MsoNormalTable" border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" width="450" style="border-collapse: collapse; border: none;"><tbody></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table>]]></td>
</tr>
